# Eight rings on rx_buf_size=5440, a 1 MiB held buffer: 256 entries are
# 128 frames a ring, the memory 4 x 512 posts; 512 entries are 256 frames
# a ring and twice that.  The port is set to eight rings by hand first
# (down, ethtool -L combined 8, up), and nfsd's threads are moved to CPUs
# 16-55: rings 4 to 7 interrupt on CPUs 8, 10, 12 and 14, which nfsd's
# usual 8-55 includes.
#     RX_LINGER_US=50 PLACE=1 STEP_BS=8M STEP_JOBS=16 PRP_DIR=/hs/stripe/zcbudget TRIM=/hs/stripe
256 1048576 0 prp step-copy-n16
512 1048576 0 prp step-copy-n16
